<mj-text mj-class="heading">You are invited to a case</mj-text>
<mj-text>A coordinator at the EEF CNA invited you to work on a vulnerability case.</mj-text>
<mj-text>
  The invite names your <%= @provider %> account <span class="handle"><%= @username %></span>.
  Sign in with that account to open the case.
</mj-text>
<mj-button href="<%= @sign_in_url %>">Sign in with <%= @provider %></mj-button>
<mj-text mj-class="link-fallback">
  Or open this link:<br /><a class="fallback" href="<%= @sign_in_url %>"><%= @sign_in_url %></a>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#dde3e7" padding="0 0 0 0" css-class="rule"></mj-divider>
<mj-text mj-class="note">
  This email holds no details about the case. You read them after you sign in.
</mj-text>
